    },
    {
      "id": "legend-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 1185,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "LEGEND & DATA FLOW SUMMARY\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Developer pushes to feature/* → App CI: test → version → build (bootJar) → image (buildah) → push to OCP dev registry\n2. App CI rollout stage: clones env repo → updates appVersion in dev/values.yaml → creates MR\n3. MR merged → Env CI: helm upgrade --install → deploys to dev namespace\n4. Release to main → App CI: build release image → oc tag promotes to prod registry → creates prod MR in env repo\n5. Manual prod MR merge → Env CI: helm upgrade --install → deploys to prod namespace\n\n🔐 Secrets: Created by Admin via oc CLI / OpenShift Console → stored in etcd → mounted as volume (/app/config/) + env vars into pods",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "seed": 90,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 90,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1700000000000
